how to install docker-compose-plugin
-------------------------------------
  apt-cache policy docker-compose-plugin = put this command then issu
  N: Unable to locate package docker-compose-plugin =  issu
    Recommended fix
    ------------------
    sudo apt update
    sudo apt install ca-certificates curl
    sudo install -m 0755 -d /etc/apt/keyrings
    sudo curl -fsSL https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu/gpg -o /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
    sudo chmod a+r /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc

      Now add Docker's repository:
      -------------------------------------
      sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.sources <<EOF
Types: deb
URIs: https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu
Suites: $(. /etc/os-release && echo "${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-$VERSION_CODENAME}")
Components: stable
Architectures: $(dpkg --print-architecture)
Signed-By: /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
EOF

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install docker-compose-plugin
  docker compose version

  E: Sub-process /usr/bin/dpkg returned an error code (1) = if show  this error
  solution
  -------------
  sudo dpkg --configure -a = Repair the interrupted package installation
  sudo apt --fix-broken install
  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install docker-compose-plugin
  docker compose version
    
  
  
  
